   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"cluster-overview\">\n<p class=\"lead\">Die Communication Services bilden das nachrichten- und signalbasierte Rückgrat der BSW: Signalextraktion, PDU-Routing ohne Payload-Inspektion (PduR) und ECU-weites Kommunikations- und Kanalmanagement (ComM).</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"sect\">Module im Cluster</h2>\n<div class=\"cards\">\n  <a class=\"card\" href=\"modules/com.html\">\n    <h3>AUTOSAR COM</h3>\n    <p>The AUTOSAR COM module provides signal-based communication services for inter-ECU exchange across diverse bus systems.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">BSW ID 50</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">55 APIs (50 Funktionen, 5 Typen)</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\"><code>#include &quot;Com.h&quot;</code></span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"card\" href=\"modules/pdur.html\">\n    <h3>PDU Router (PduR)</h3>\n    <p>The PDU Router routes I-PDUs between communication interfaces, transport protocols, and upper layers without payload inspection.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">BSW ID 51</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">9 APIs (5 Funktionen, 4 Typen)</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\"><code>#include &quot;PduR.h&quot;</code></span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"card\" href=\"modules/comm.html\">\n    <h3>Communication Manager (ComM)</h3>\n    <p>Manages communication states and channel modes across multiple network interfaces.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">BSW ID 12</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">47 APIs (36 Funktionen, 11 Typen)</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\"><code>#include &quot;ComM.h&quot;</code></span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  }
 ],
